## The 2026 Swedish Cup

While international guests featured near the top of the results during the Swedish Championships weekend, the overall [2026 Swedish Cup](/svenska-cupen-mtbo-2026) standings rewarded riders who competed consistently across the domestic season.

Overall winners of the 2026 Swedish Cup:

- **M21:** Rasmus Nordgren, OK Kåre
- **W21:** Gabriella Gustafsson, IKHP Huskvarna
- **M17–20:** Joel Holmgård, Kils OK
- **W17–20:** Signe Feil, Sundsvalls OK

## Looking ahead to 2027

As we close the 2026 season, preparations are already in place for 2027. The new season starts in April with [MTBO Camp and the Swedish Cup in Skåne](/events/mtbo-camp-skane-2027?lang=en) (14–18 April), followed by [Karlskrona](/events/svenska-cupen-karlskrona-2027?lang=en) and the [first Swedish Championship weekend in Falun](/events/sm-mtbo-falun-2027?lang=en) in May, [MTBO at O-Ringen in Stockholm](/en/mtbo-oringen) in July, and [Sätervurpan](/events/svenska-cupen-satervurpan-2027?lang=en) and the [second Swedish Championship weekend in Tranemo](/events/sm-mtbo-tranemo-2027?lang=en) in August.
